        {
          "text": "Mumwaka wamakumi otatwe, mumwezi wane, mubuzuba bwasanu bwamumwezi, ndakali akati kabazike kumulonga wa-Kebara, elyo ijulu lyakajaluka, nkabela ndakabona zilengano zya-Leza. ",
