        {
          "text": "Lino nindakalanga, ndakabona muuwo uungisya uuzwa kulubazu lwakunyika, ajoba ipati, amulilo uuvutuka-vutuka lyoonse, akubalangala kuzyungulukide, alimwi mukati kamulilo mwakaboneka mbuli mundalila uusalalisya uupya munsaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
