                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuboobo masyu aabo mbwaakabede. Nkabela mababa aabo akalitandabikidwe kujulu; umwi aumwi kajisi mababa obile aagumene mababa aamweenzinyina, amababa obile aavumbide mubili wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela umwi aumwi kalulama mukweenda kwakwe. Kufumbwa muuya nkuwakali kuyanda kuya, bakaya nkukonya, akutaleyauka pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
