        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela akati kabanyama kakuli mbuli malasa aayaka, mbuli malampi aakali kweendeenda akati kabanyama. Mulilo wakali kunyengema, alimwi mukati kamulilo mwakazwa lulabo. ",
          "type": "text",
