              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibakainka, aalo akainka; nibakaima, aalo akaima, alimwi nibakasumpulwa kuzwa ansi, aalo akasumpulwa kumbali lyabo, nkaambo mumavili momwakali muuya wabanyama.",
