              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino kunsi lyamwenya oyo, mababa aabo akalitandabede cakululama, limwi alimwi lyakaliswaneene abbabanyina, alimwi umwi aumwi kajisi mababa obile aakulivumbya mubili wakwe. ",
