        {
          "text": "Nkabela nibakali kweenda, ndakamvwa cikwala camababa aabo mbuli cikwala camaanzi aavuuma, mbuli ijwi lya­-Cilenga, cikwala calupyopyongano mbuli cikwala camakamu makamu aabasilumamba. Lino baime buyo, bakavunga mababa aabo. ",
