        {
          "text": "Alimwi kujulu lyamwenya oyo iwakali atala lyamitwe yabo kwakaboneka cili mbuli cuuno cabwami, cakali mbuli ibbwe lya-Safiro, nkabela atala acintu eco cakali mbuli cuuno akakede mbuli muntu. ",
